# Twin Cakery ERP - API base URL.

# Override this to point the frontend at the deployed backend origin.
# Example for a Vercel deployment (the root URL of the frontend):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://<your-app>.vercel.app/api/v1
#
# Default is a relative path, so the API resolves against the frontend's own
# origin (recommended so the same build works across environments).
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
